test "ensure points sorted numerically" {
    try check("Devastating Donkeys;Blithering Badgers;win
Devastating Donkeys;Blithering Badgers;win
Devastating Donkeys;Blithering Badgers;win
Devastating Donkeys;Blithering Badgers;win
